com,"$Upset that NL President Lynch assigned a local amateur"
com,"to umpire this makeup of a postponed game, and"
com,"exacerbated by several early calls going against them,"
com,"the Cardinals employed 'rowdy antics' throughout the game"
com,"towards the umpire. St Louis manager Bresnahan played"
com,"several players out of their normal position (including"
com,"having two position players pitch) and turned the game"
com,"into a farce. Bresnahan later protested the game (which"
com,"was strongly denied)."
